        "original_id": "70b43423-3096-5efa-9a89-82946d55eb0a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Robinsons, Pocari Sweat, Robinsons barley water\n- Companies: Britvic, Otsuka Pharmaceutical\n- People: Hugh Manning, Kathleen Harrison\n- Works: Mrs Thursday, Gekidō/Just Break the Limit!\n- Topics: TV commercials, drink branding\n\nFacts:\n- Robinsons is an English fruit drink brand owned by Britvic.\n- Pocari Sweat is a Japanese sports drink manufactured by Otsuka Pharmaceutical.\n- Pocari Sweat was launched in 1980 and is available in East Asia, Southeast Asia, and the Middle East.\n- In 1966, Hugh Manning starred in the TV series Mrs Thursday alongside Kathleen Harrison.\n- In Mrs Thursday, Hugh Manning played a suave and imperturbable butler.\n- Hugh Manning’s butler character also appeared in popular TV commercials endorsing Robinsons barley water.\n- Gekidō/Just Break the Limit! was used in a commercial for Pocari Sweat.",
